WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.975
Aqua Sentinel.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:04.664
Intelligence to protect every drop.

00:00:04.664 --> 00:00:11.270
This is an illustrative animation, with simulated data from a community water network.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.521
Meet a community water network.

00:00:14.521 --> 00:00:18.312
Sensors measure pressure, flow, and water quality.

00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:23.620
All of its data is synthetic, and the platform labels it as simulated.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.706
A leak starts on a pipe section.

00:00:26.706 --> 00:00:31.350
The meters show that more water enters the network than is consumed.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:38.253
The deterministic engine detects the anomaly, using physical rules and a water balance.

00:00:38.253 --> 00:00:41.014
It never invents confidence percentages.

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:46.810
It reports a support level, based on how many independent sources of evidence agree.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.771
Every data point shows where it comes from:

00:00:50.771 --> 00:00:53.832
measured, inferred, declared, or simulated.

00:00:53.832 --> 00:00:58.530
A photo that no vision model has analyzed is not used as evidence.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:03.345
A person reviews the recommendation, and decides.

00:01:03.345 --> 00:01:07.660
Accepting it creates a work order, with its task list.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.951
The crew starts the job, and checks off each task.

00:01:11.951 --> 00:01:16.360
Every change is recorded with the name of the person who made it.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:25.290
The order can only be closed when every task is complete and a photo is attached, sealed with its SHA-256 fingerprint.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:31.076
After closing, the platform does not assume the site has recovered.

00:01:31.076 --> 00:01:35.670
It stays pending verification, until a new measurement arrives.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:41.061
The next measurement arrives, also simulated in this demo.

00:01:41.061 --> 00:01:45.940
It is back to normal, so the recovery is measured, not assumed.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.649
Everything is written to the Trust Ledger, a hash chain that can be verified.

00:01:51.649 --> 00:01:58.770
It proves the integrity of the record, but it does not guarantee that whoever controls the server cannot alter it.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:00.765
Aqua Sentinel:

00:02:00.765 --> 00:02:03.892
from an anomaly, to a verifiable action.

00:02:03.892 --> 00:02:10.850
Built with Kiro, from specifications, to requirements, tests, and automated verification.
